==Strategy==
While Rathian can be slowly killed by units with high range, it outranges a very large number of units. While it is not strong, its [[Strengthen]] ability will make it more annoying. You can choose to either tank it out or bring long range units such as [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]].

